h-title="true" id="page-title">The Academy</h1><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-bone/20 pt-5 lg:mt-9 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div class="flex items-end gap-6"><button aria-label="Scroll to the next section" class="group/cue hidden items-center sm:flex" data-ph-fade="true" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative block h-10 w-px overflow-hidden bg-bone/25"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 block h-1/2 animate-scroll-cue bg-bone"></span></span></button><p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.2vw,2rem)] italic leading-snug text-bone/90" data-ph-fade="true">Practice, measured to the millimetre, from first light to floodlight.</p></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-8 lg:shrink-0" data-ph-fade="true"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Tracked bays</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">48</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">PGA pros</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">11</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Short game</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">3 ha</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="academy-intro-label" class="relative z-10 -mt-px overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.75rem] bg-bone text-charcoal shadow-[0_-30px_70px_-20px_rgba(9,17,12,0.55)] sm:rounded-t-[2.5rem]" id="academy-intro"><div class="px-5 pb-24 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-28"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70" id="academy-intro-label"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Practice with purpose</span></h2><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">Range · Short game · Putting · Studio</p></div><p class="mt-12 max-w-[68rem] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16 [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" data-intro-statement="true">Every swing leaves data behind. <em>We turn it into a plan</em>, and the plan into lower scores.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75 lg:col-span-4" data-reveal="true">The Academy is run by eleven PGA professionals around one idea: practice should feel like golf. Every bay, green and bunker is tracked, and every session ends with a clear next step sent to your phone.</p><div class="lg:col-span-8"><dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">range with target greens shaped like the course</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="320" data-decimals="0">320</span> m</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">practice venues, from the range to the floodlit Short Nine</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="5" data-decimals="0">5</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">week Performance Plan for serious improvers</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="12" data-decimals="0">12</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">custom fitting session on the launch monitor</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="90" data-decimals="0">90</span> min</span></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="academy-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-forest text-bone" id="academy"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full text-bone opacity-[0.06]" focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid slice" viewbox="0 0 1600 1200"><g aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></g></svg><div class="relative px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">02</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Academy &amp; practice</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.6vw,4.6rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="academy-heading">Practice, <em class="font-serif font-normal">measured to the millimetre.</em></h2></div><div class="self-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-bone/75" data-reveal="true">Every bay, green and bunker in the Academy is tracked, so practice turns into progress you can see. The technology stays out of sight. The feedback doesn't.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-5" data-reveal="true"><button class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-bone px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-ochre" type="button">Book a lesson<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><ol class="lg:col-span-5"><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-100" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A golfer mid-swing in a covered range bay at dusk, with the floodlit range stretching beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/golf-academy-range.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">The Range</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">Forty-eight bays, half covered and heated, with ball-flight tracking on every one. Target greens stretch 320 metres and are shaped like the course’s own.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">48 tracked bays</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">320 m range</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">06:30 to 22:00</li></ul></li><li class="border-t bord