:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">60 minutes</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Private lesson</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">One hour with a PGA professional on any part of your game, recorded and sent to your phone.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Video analysis</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Launch data</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Practice plan</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request Private lesson" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border border-bone/15 bg-bone/[0.03] p-6 transition-[translate,background-color,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-bone/35 hover:bg-bone/[0.06] lg:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">02</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">12 weeks</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Performance Plan</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">An assessment, eight lessons and two playing sessions on the course, built around clear targets.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">3D motion capture</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Two on-course lessons</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Fitting review</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request Performance Plan" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border border-bone/15 bg-bone/[0.03] p-6 transition-[translate,background-color,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-bone/35 hover:bg-bone/[0.06] lg:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">03</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">3 mornings</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Short Game School</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Chipping, bunker play and putting in the Short Game Park and Putting Lab, in groups of four.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Groups of four</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Putting Lab session</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Lunch on the Terrace</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request Short Game School" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border border-bone/15 bg-bone/[0.03] p-6 transition-[translate,background-color,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-bone/35 hover:bg-bone/[0.06] lg:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">4 sessions</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">First Swing</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">For complete beginners. Four relaxed sessions, then your first round together on the Short Nine.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Clubs provided</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Rules and etiquette</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Round on the Short Nine</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request First Swing" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border border-bone/15 bg-bone/[0.03] p-6 transition-[translate,background-color,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-bone/35 hover:bg-bone/[0.06] lg:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">Termly</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Junior Academy</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Weekend coaching for ages six to seventeen, grouped by age and ability, with a junior tour in summer.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Ages 6 to 17</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Weekend groups</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Summer junior tour</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request Junior Academy" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border border-bone/15 bg-bone/[0.03] p-6 transition-[translate,background-color,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-bone/35 hover:bg-bone/[0.06] lg:p-8" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/55"><span class="tabular-nums">06</span><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 text-ochre">90 minutes</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-2xl font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Custom fitting</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Every major maker, every shaft, measured on the launch monitor and then on the course itself.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">All major makers</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">Launch monitor</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-bone/75">On-course check</li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><button aria-label="Request Custom fitting" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-bone/30 text-bone hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal w-full justify-between" type="button">Request<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></li></ul></div></section><section aria-labelledby="studio-session-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="studio-session"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>The Performance Studio</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="studio-session-heading">An hour that changes <em>how you practise.</em></h2></div><p class="self-end text-base leading-relaxed lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Motion capture, launch data and a coach who knows which three numbers matter for your game.</p></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-forest">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Capture</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Fifteen minutes of 3D motion capture and launch monitoring records how your body and the ball really move.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-forest">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Understand</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Your coach walks you through the numbers that matter, and leaves out the ones that do not.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-forest">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Train</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Drills built for your swing, on the range, in the Short Game Park or in the Putting Lab.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-forest">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Review</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">A report lands on your phone before you reach the car, with your next session already suggested.</p></li></ol></div></section><section aria-labelledby="academy-questions-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-paper text-charcoal" id="academy-questions"><div class="grid gap-12 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Questions</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="academy-questions-heading">Before <em>your first session.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Anything else, the Academy team is on the range from half past six every morning.</p></div></div><ul class="border-t lg:col-span-7 border-charcoal/15"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-0" aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-0" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Do I need to be a member to take lessons?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20 rotate-45"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="false" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[1fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-0" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">No. Lessons, programmes, fitting and the practice facilities are open to everyone. Members simply book further ahead and at member rates.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-1" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-1" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">What should I bring?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-1" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Your clubs and golf shoes if you have them. If not, rental sets and shoes are waiting at the pro shop at no charge for First Swing players.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-2" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-2" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Can children join the Junior Academy mid-term?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-2" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Yes, whenever there is space in their age group. A coach meets every new junior for a short assessment first.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-3" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-3" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Is the range open in the evening?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-3" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">The range is floodlit and open until ten at night, and the Short Nine until eleven.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></section><section aria-label="Next page" class="relative z-10 bg-charcoal"><a class="group r